## 3. Proposed Changes

### 3.1. Application Backend (`server/`)

#### Dependencies to Add:
- `bcryptjs`: Password hashing (pure JS, cross-platform stability on Windows).
- `jsonwebtoken`: Secure JWT token creation and verification.

#### [NEW] [server/src/models/User.js](file:///c:/Users/Dinkar%20Tiwari/OneDrive/Documents/Desktop/Final_year_project/server/src/models/User.js)
- Fields:
  - `name`: String, required, trimmed.
  - `email`: String, required, unique, lowercase, trimmed, email regex validated.
  - `password`: String, required, min 6 characters, `select: false` (never returned in queries by default).
  - `createdAt`: Date.
- Methods:
  - `matchPassword(enteredPassword)`: Compares candidate password against bcrypt hash.
  - Pre-save hook: Automatically hashes password with salt before saving if modified.

#### [NEW] [server/src/utils/jwt.js](file:///c:/Users/Dinkar%20Tiwari/OneDrive/Documents/Desktop/Final_year_project/server/src/utils/jwt.js)
- `generateToken(userId)`: Generates signed JWT with configurable expiration (default: 7 days).
- `verifyToken(token)`: Verifies and decodes JWT payload.

#### [NEW] [server/src/middleware/authMiddleware.js](file:///c:/Users/Dinkar%20Tiwari/OneDrive/Documents/Desktop/Final_year_project/server/src/middleware/authMiddleware.js)
- `protect`: Extracts `Bearer <token>` from `Authorization` header, decodes user ID, retrieves `User` from MongoDB, and attaches `req.user`. Returns 401 if missing or invalid.
- `optionalAuth`: Checks for token; if valid, populates `req.user`, but does not reject the request if absent.

#### [NEW] [server/src/controllers/authController.js](file:///c:/Users/Dinkar%20Tiwari/OneDrive/Documents/Desktop/Final_year_project/server/src/controllers/authController.js)
- `register(req, res)`: Validates name, email, password; checks existing email; creates user; returns JWT token + user object.
- `login(req, res)`: Validates credentials; checks password with `bcryptjs`; returns JWT token + user object.
- `getMe(req, res)`: Returns current user data (`_id`, `name`, `email`, `createdAt`).

#### [NEW] [server/src/routes/authRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/Dinkar%20Tiwari/OneDrive/Documents/Desktop/Final_year_project/server/src/routes/authRoutes.js)
